WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.259
Lower on the Dashboard, the charts show where the money and the orders are.

00:00:04.713 --> 00:00:10.379
Click Month, 6 months or Year to change the time shown, and point at the chart for the exact amount.

00:00:11.403 --> 00:00:15.385
Click a vendor's name to see the vendor P Os it still has to deliver.

00:00:15.837 --> 00:00:20.725
Click a step in the order pipeline, or a colour in ageing, to list those orders.

00:00:22.242 --> 00:00:26.886
Click a top part to see its open orders, its MOQ, and its vendors.

00:00:27.338 --> 00:00:32.957
Next shipments lists the next orders to ship, and Customer Spend shows what John Deere received.
